          "source_excerpt_hash": "173f53b57e64e494a90875c788e3b1a193435b02de3801e5cc54b3eb2760999b",
          "text": "公司与中际旭创、新易盛、光迅科技、Lumentum、Coherent、环球广电、日本住友等国内外主流光通信企业达成合作关系。"
        },
        {
          "char_count": 322,
          "excerpt_id": "curated:commercialization:91f57a47205bd8d2:4:excerpt:2",
          "matched_terms": [
